        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective story. A cat accidentally gets infected with a secret computer virus and gains superpowers. Agents try to catch the cat, who is causing chaos in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D novella with text subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is as follows. During the game, in different scenes on the screen there is a person or people. You need to point the game mouse at them. A mouth appears. This means that you need to click on this person to find out what they are saying. Text appears below. If you point the mouse at a person and the mouth does not appear, then you need to find an object that you need to click on. When you point the game mouse at such an object, a hand will appear. After that, you need to click on this object. You need to read all the dialogues of the characters to understand the meaning of the detective story.</p>",
